{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","伊温"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名温柔的医师，具有持续性的治疗能力。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","是、是叫我吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Ah- Are you calling me?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","雨水能让新芽长得更快……"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Rain's touch'll help new shoots grow faster."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","雨啊，洗刷伤痛吧……"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Wash away all sorrows, o rain."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","好想……回家……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I really want to... go home..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","大家都没事吧？"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","那、那个……我在听雨，你想一起吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","不是故意的…"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","我太困了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","好像有水滴，幸好有叶子呀，谢谢你。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好温柔的感觉呀……谢谢你，特别为我准备礼物……"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","送给我的……礼物？谢、谢谢……"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","温然叶脉"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","翠色湖畔的雨那样温润，轻柔得如同一声叹息。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","温煦雪夜"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","雪后的冬夜格外宁静，人们在忙着做温暖又昏沉的梦。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","金玫瑰高定商店兑换获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","传说"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好安静啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","外面下雨了吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","薄荷柠檬水很清爽……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","下雪了，有点冷"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","冬天的夜晚，很安静"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","可爱的小灯笼……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","烟花真美丽啊"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","伊温自言自语时，会将所有心声一字一句说出口，是个探听秘密的好时机。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","伊温撑着的叶子曾比现在更大，但后来她发现自己并不想完全与世隔绝，于是将叶子保持在能挡住自己却不阻碍交流的大小。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","附近的居民在情人之愿约会时，常见到笑得一脸幸福，连用叶子遮挡自己都忘记了的伊温。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","伊温几乎不吃普通的食物，只饮用清晨的露水来保持魔力的纯净。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","伊温悲伤时，周围会下起雨，为了防止给周遭居民造成不便，她常常试图控制涌上心头的负面情绪。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","“有一次去情人之愿探查水质，和水边一个举着叶子的女孩打了声招呼。结果她惊叫一声缩进水里了——我还以为她溺水了呢！”来自达米安的回忆。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","叶角熊们是伊温的伙伴，伊温常被叶角熊邀请去分享它们采来的蜂蜜。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说，有人在塔兰河附近分手的话，那天的雨会下得特别大。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","伊温会经常更换她手中的叶片，那往往是她最恐慌的时刻——因为寻找新叶片的时候，最容易被其他人目击到。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","拜伊温的魔力所赐，情人之愿和塔兰河的水即便在寒冬也不会冻结。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","啊哟！又撞到头了……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415016.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","伊温 & 达米安"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","啊，是……是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>…………您好，谢谢您的招待。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415026.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","伊温 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","好安静啊……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415098.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","伊温"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","薄荷柠檬水很清爽……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415099.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","伊温"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","下雪了，有点冷"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415407.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","伊温"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","冬天的夜晚，很安静"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415408.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","伊温"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","可爱的小灯笼……"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415579.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","伊温"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","烟花真美丽啊"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415580.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","伊温"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","我注意到你一直用荷叶遮着脸，在叶子的缝隙里悄悄看我呢。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415731.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","娑丽丝 & 伊温"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","伊温，听说塔兰村的人在村子里为你准备了一间满是鲜花的木屋？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413010.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","芙拉贝尔 & 伊温"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"]]}